# Chains of Mephistopheles applied before Laboratory Maniac (CR 616.1) with nothing in hand and nothing in the library: there
# is no card to discard, so the draw becomes a mill of one card, which from an empty library mills nothing (CR 614.6: the
# impossible instruction is ignored). The draw was replaced, so Laboratory Maniac has no draw left to replace, and Bot1
# neither wins nor loses for drawing from an empty library (CR 704.5b): it never tried to draw. Bot1 casts its whole
# seven-card deck on turn 1 and has Chains apply first to each of Ancestral Recall's three draws.

